{{!--
  The checked / unchecked square a toggle button shows (#696). Decorative: the
  button it sits in carries the state as `aria-pressed` and the name as its text or
  `aria-label`, so the icon is hidden from assistive tech and is never a second
  control beside a real checkbox.

  Hash arguments:
    on        — truthy when the toggle is on. Required.
    iconClass — extra classes for the icon (size, opacity). Optional.
--}}
<i class="fas {{#if on}}fa-check-square{{else}}fa-square{{/if}}{{#if iconClass}} {{iconClass}}{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true" data-toggle-icon></i>
